#9901
warg malignant~
the malignant warg~
A malignant warg is here chained to the wall.
~
This is the largest warg you have ever seen.  It seems to have been bread from
 the wargs of the forest, however only there strongest and nastiest qualities
 have survived.  Its huge claws and teeth glisten in the dim light.  Its
 gleaming eyes pierce through the darkness in search of its next meal.
~
